otency key. The incident was opened once.\n\nThe incident summary covers the partial failure and the retry. The follow-up is to investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error before anyone redeploys v2.3.1 or v2.3.1-rc.", "type": "text"}]}]}